  "title": "Red Velvet Cupcakes",
  "description": "These red velvet cupcakes are soft, moist, and buttery. They&#39;re topped with a homemade tangy vanilla cream cheese frosting for a gorgeous sweet treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
  "date_published": "2009-11-03T20:13:42-05:00",
